    - rid: 4927988405324218406
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (But when would I find the time?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218407
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I think the only reason I still have the title of guard captain is because
      saving the world takes priority over petty thievery.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I still don't really know what exactly I'm supposed to do, ahaha...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218408
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I guess I'm lucky my fake-it-'til-you-make-it-strategy's been working
      out so far.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218409
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218410
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I don't even know where I'm supposed to be patrolling-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218411
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Around that cave that we raided, where we found Natsuki?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218412
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c3dd8de5b66462c489c46f09a84b83a5, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218425
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Hmm?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, hi Natsuki.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218415
    - rid: 4927988405324218416
    - rid: 4927988405324218414
    - rid: 4927988405324218426
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} and I went and got his sword earlier today-'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218417
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: And we were wondering what you were up to, since you weren't at the Skyforge.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218418
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Guh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218420
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Are... you alright?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218419
    - rid: 4927988405324218427
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: No!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218421
    - rid: 4927988405324218423
    - rid: 4927988405324218424
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm sorry?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218428
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Just come with me for a bit, I'm pissed and need to rant.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218429
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, uh, alright then...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218430
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So... what happened?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218433
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Huuhh... alright.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218434
    - rid: 4927988405324218435
